1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,800
It started with one word.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,800
Later was always easier than now.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,800
You'll feel ready tomorrow.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,800
Every excuse fed it.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:19,800
Tomorrow was already arriving.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,800
He carried yesterday into his sleep.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,800
Tomorrow has never once arrived.

8
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,800
He wasn't fighting time. He was feeding it.

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,800
Five minutes.

10
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,800
You have to starve it in the light.

11
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,800
It only lives where you refuse to go.

12
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:47,500
Wake up. It's time.
